OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain, mostly
OL,6,Flight, will become widespread this
OL,7,Fevening before clearing from most
OL,8,Fareas overnight, though it may linger
OL,9,Fin Kent. Clearer skies will follow,
OL,10,Fwith a chilly night and patches of
OL,11,Fmist and fog developing by dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FAny lingering overnight
OL,14,Fcloud will soon clear to leave a fine
OL,15,Fand dry day with light winds and
OL,16,Fplenty of sunshine, though hazy at
OL,17,Ftimes. Feeling pleasantly warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
