OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FFine,
OL,6,Fthough breezy, on Sunday before rain
OL,7,Fspreads east during the late
OL,8,Fafternoon. Monday looks largely dry
OL,9,Fand pleasant. Mostly dry though
OL,10,Fturning increasingly windy on Tuesday.
OL,11,FTemperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
